%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f0b0c553be8edd4682e9180fdd13e37, type: 3}
  m_Name: I2Languages
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::I2.Loc.LanguageSourceAsset
  mSource:
    UserAgreesToHaveItOnTheScene: 0
    UserAgreesToHaveItInsideThePluginsFolder: 0
    GoogleLiveSyncIsUptoDate: 1
    mTerms:
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*Cosmic Critters* emerge from the bio-luminescent flora; engage defensive
        protocols!'
      - "*Qu\xE1i V\u0169 Tr\u1EE5* tr\u1ED3i l\xEAn t\u1EEB \u0111\xE1m th\u1EF1c
        v\u1EADt ph\xE1t s\xE1ng; k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t giao th\u1EE9c ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A wild *{e}* blocks the trail, hissing static; you have no choice but to
        strike first.
      - "M\u1ED9t con *{e}* hoang d\xE3 ch\u1EB7n \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng, r\xEDt l\xEAn
        nh\u01B0 nhi\u1EC5u s\xF3ng; b\u1EA1n bu\u1ED9c ph\u1EA3i ra tay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Sensors ping - *{e}* burrows out of the glowshroom bed, fangs first!
      - "C\u1EA3m bi\u1EBFn b\xE1o \u0111\u1ED9ng - *{e}* chui l\xEAn t\u1EEB lu\u1ED1ng
        n\u1EA5m ph\xE1t quang, nanh nh\u1ECDn d\u1EF1ng \u0111\u1EE9ng!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/4
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The lake bubbles... a hungry *{e}* surfaces and charges!
      - "M\u1EB7t h\u1ED3 s\u1EE7i b\u1ECDt... m\u1ED9t con *{e}* \u0111\xF3i kh\xE1t
        tr\u1ED3i l\xEAn v\xE0 lao t\u1EDBi!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BattleIntro/5
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Your translator crackles: "*{e}* claims this territory. Prepare!"'
      - "M\xE1y phi\xEAn d\u1ECBch r\xE8 l\xEAn: \"*{e}* tuy\xEAn b\u1ED1 l\xE3nh
        th\u1ED5 n\xE0y. Chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB \u0111i!\""
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/EliteIntro/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - An *irradiated {e}* looms ahead, crackling with unstable energy!
      - "M\u1ED9t con *{e} nhi\u1EC5m x\u1EA1* s\u1EEBng s\u1EEFng ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc,
        n\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng b\u1EA5t \u1ED5n n\u1ED5 l\xE9p b\xE9p!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/EliteIntro/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - This *{e}* has feasted on starlight - larger, meaner, hungrier.
      - "Con *{e}* n\xE0y \u0111\xE3 nu\u1ED1t tr\u1ECDn \xE1nh sao - to h\u01A1n,
        d\u1EEF h\u01A1n, \u0111\xF3i h\u01A1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BossIntro/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The ground trembles. *{e}*, tyrant of this world, descends!
      - "M\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t rung chuy\u1EC3n. *{e}*, b\u1EA1o ch\xFAa c\u1EE7a
        th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi n\xE0y, gi\xE1ng l\xE2m!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/BossIntro/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - All flora dims. *{e}* has found you.
      - "M\u1ECDi \xE1nh s\xE1ng th\u1EF1c v\u1EADt v\u1EE5t t\u1EAFt. *{e}* \u0111\xE3
        t\xECm ra b\u1EA1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Win/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The *{e}* dissolves into stardust. You absorb <b>+{xp} XP</b>.
      - "*{e}* tan th\xE0nh b\u1EE5i sao. B\u1EA1n h\u1EA5p th\u1EE5 <b>+{xp} XP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Win/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*{e}* flees into the flora, defeated. <b>+{xp} XP</b> gathered.'
      - "*{e}* b\u1EA1i tr\u1EADn, ch\u1EA1y tr\u1ED1n v\xE0o \u0111\xE1m th\u1EF1c
        v\u1EADt. Thu \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c <b>+{xp} XP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Win/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Threat neutralized. Cosmic residue grants <b>+{xp} XP</b>.
      - "M\u1ED1i \u0111e d\u1ECDa b\u1ECB v\xF4 hi\u1EC7u. T\xE0n d\u01B0 v\u0169
        tr\u1EE5 mang l\u1EA1i <b>+{xp} XP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Fortune/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A drifting *spore of luck* settles on your antenna.
      - "M\u1ED9t *b\xE0o t\u1EED may m\u1EAFn* tr\xF4i d\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EADu l\xEAn
        r\xE2u \u0103ng-ten c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Fortune/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You sip glowing dew from a crystal leaf. Refreshing!
      - "B\u1EA1n nh\u1EA5p gi\u1ECDt s\u01B0\u01A1ng ph\xE1t s\xE1ng tr\xEAn chi\u1EBFc
        l\xE1 pha l\xEA. S\u1EA3ng kho\xE1i!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Fortune/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A tiny *star fragment* fuses with your suit.
      - "M\u1ED9t *m\u1EA3nh sao* t\xED hon h\u1EE3p nh\u1EA5t v\xE0o b\u1ED9 gi\xE1p
        c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Choice/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A derelict *supply pod* cracks open, offering strange tech...
      - "M\u1ED9t *khoang ti\u1EBFp t\u1EBF* b\u1ECF hoang b\u1EADt m\u1EDF, h\xE9
        l\u1ED9 c\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 l\u1EA1..."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Choice/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'The flora whispers of *mutation*. Choose your evolution:'
      - "\u0110\xE1m th\u1EF1c v\u1EADt th\xEC th\u1EA7m v\u1EC1 *\u0111\u1ED9t bi\u1EBFn*.
        Ch\u1ECDn h\u01B0\u1EDBng ti\u1EBFn h\xF3a c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n:"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Choice/3
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - An ancient vending machine hums to life. *Pick one:*
      - "M\u1ED9t m\xE1y b\xE1n h\xE0ng c\u1ED5 \u0111\u1EA1i rung l\xEAn kh\u1EDFi
        \u0111\u1ED9ng. *Ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t:*"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Spring/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You discover a *bio-luminescent spring* and soak your weary tentacles. <b>+{heal}
        HP</b>.
      - "B\u1EA1n t\xECm th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t *su\u1ED1i ph\xE1t quang sinh h\u1ECDc*
        v\xE0 ng\xE2m \u0111\xE1m x\xFAc tu r\xE3 r\u1EDDi. <b>+{heal} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Spring/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Friendly micro-critters knit your wounds. <b>+{heal} HP</b>.
      - "L\u0169 vi sinh v\u1EADt th\xE2n thi\u1EC7n v\xE1 l\xE0nh v\u1EBFt th\u01B0\u01A1ng
        cho b\u1EA1n. <b>+{heal} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Sidekick/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A curious *{s}* bobs out of the flora and decides you are its best friend!
      - "M\u1ED9t con *{s}* t\xF2 m\xF2 nh\xFAn nh\u1EA3y ra kh\u1ECFi l\xF9m c\xE2y
        v\xE0 quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh b\u1EA1n l\xE0 b\u1EA1n th\xE2n c\u1EE7a
        n\xF3!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Sidekick/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*{s}* the cosmic critter joins your voyage!'
      - "*{s}*, sinh v\u1EADt v\u0169 tr\u1EE5, gia nh\u1EADp h\xE0nh tr\xECnh c\u1EE7a
        b\u1EA1n!"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickFull/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - It waves goodbye and gifts you a *snack* instead. <b>+{heal} HP</b>.
      - "N\xF3 v\u1EABy tay t\u1EA1m bi\u1EC7t v\xE0 t\u1EB7ng b\u1EA1n m\u1ED9t
        *b\u1EEFa \u0103n nh\u1EB9* thay l\u1EDDi ch\xE0o. <b>+{heal} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickJoin
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ' <b>{s}</b> {d}.'
      - ' <b>{s}</b> {d}.'
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickPodFull
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ' But your pod is full - make room, or send it off with a snack?'
      - " Nh\u01B0ng khoang c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1EA7y - d\u1ECDn
        ch\u1ED7, hay ti\u1EC5n n\xF3 \u0111i k\xE8m m\u1ED9t b\u1EEFa \u0103n nh\u1EB9?"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/SidekickSwap
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - '*{r}* waves goodbye and drifts into the flora. <b>{s}</b> {d}.'
      - "*{r}* v\u1EABy tay t\u1EA1m bi\u1EC7t v\xE0 tr\xF4i v\xE0o l\xF9m c\xE2y.
        <b>{s}</b> {d}."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Trap/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You step on a *snapvine*! It lashes out before you break free. <b>-{dmg}
        HP</b>.
      - "B\u1EA1n gi\u1EABm ph\u1EA3i *d\xE2y leo \u0111\u1EDBp*! N\xF3 qu\u1EADt
        m\u1EA1nh tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi b\u1EA1n tho\xE1t ra. <b>-{dmg} HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Trap/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - A gas bloom bursts - *toxic spores*! <b>-{dmg} HP</b>.
      - "M\u1ED9t t\xFAi kh\xED bung ra - *b\xE0o t\u1EED \u0111\u1ED9c*! <b>-{dmg}
        HP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Treasure/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - 'Half-buried in the moss: an *alien artifact*! Analyzing grants <b>+{xp}
        XP</b>.'
      - "V\xF9i n\u1EEDa trong r\xEAu: m\u1ED9t *c\u1ED5 v\u1EADt ngo\xE0i h\xE0nh
        tinh*! Ph\xE2n t\xEDch n\xF3 cho <b>+{xp} XP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Treasure/2
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You crack open a *meteor geode* full of knowledge crystals. <b>+{xp} XP</b>.
      - "B\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EADp v\u1EE1 m\u1ED9t *kh\u1ED1i thi\xEAn th\u1EA1ch*
        \u0111\u1EA7y tinh th\u1EC3 tri th\u1EE9c. <b>+{xp} XP</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/PlanetClear/1
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The skies calm. *{p}* is pacified - your ship beams you to the next world.
      - "B\u1EA7u tr\u1EDDi l\u1EB7ng xu\u1ED1ng. *{p}* \u0111\xE3 b\xECnh y\xEAn
        - phi thuy\u1EC1n d\u1ECBch chuy\u1EC3n b\u1EA1n t\u1EDBi th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi
        k\u1EBF ti\u1EBFp."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/LevelUpSuffix
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - ' <b>Level up! Lv.{lv}</b>'
      - " <b>L\xEAn c\u1EA5p! C\u1EA5p {lv}</b>"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/IntroNewRun
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You beam down onto *{p}* - bio-luminescent flora hums in the dusk. Tap <b>ENGAGE</b>
        to explore.
      - "B\u1EA1n d\u1ECBch chuy\u1EC3n xu\u1ED1ng *{p}* - th\u1EF1c v\u1EADt ph\xE1t
        quang ng\xE2n nga trong ho\xE0ng h\xF4n. Ch\u1EA1m <b>XU\u1EA4T PH\xC1T</b>
        \u0111\u1EC3 kh\xE1m ph\xE1."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/IntroResume
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Signal restored - your voyage on *{p}* continues. Tap <b>ENGAGE</b>.
      - "T\xEDn hi\u1EC7u kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c - h\xE0nh tr\xECnh c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n
        tr\xEAn *{p}* ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c. Ch\u1EA1m <b>XU\u1EA4T PH\xC1T</b>."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/Death
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Your suit's life support fades... the *{e}* was too much. The mothership
        retrieves your escape pod.
      - "H\u1EC7 duy tr\xEC s\u1EF1 s\u1ED1ng t\u1EAFt d\u1EA7n... *{e}* qu\xE1 m\u1EA1nh.
        T\xE0u m\u1EB9 thu h\u1ED3i khoang tho\xE1t hi\u1EC3m c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Narrative/ElitePrefix
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Irradiated {e}
      - "{e} Nhi\u1EC5m X\u1EA1"
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
